  "body": "Phone for a private viewing. \r\n\r\nSurrounded by homes of significantly higher value, this property presents an exciting opportunity for those with vision.\r\n\r\nOver 1000m2 (more or less) with expansive views in superior location in central Takapuna.\r\n\r\nTakapuna is rated as one of the top suburbs in the whole of New Zealand and this exceptional property is situated on a prime waterfront location that is not only elevated and sunny but also very private.\r\n\r\nModernise or Build your Dream Home.\r\n\r\nStep into a world where timeless character meets breath taking potential. This expansive weatherboard residence stands proudly on the clifftop, offering sweeping views that will leave you inspired every single day. Set just three along from Takapuna beach offering highly sought after privacy yet immediate access for that daily swim or stroll to the central Takapuna shops and cafes.\r\n\r\nFeaturing five generous bedrooms and three well-appointed bathrooms, there is ample space for family and guests. The two large living spaces both feature French doors that flow to both covered decking and an elevated veranda.\r\n\r\nImagine mornings spent with coffee in hand, savouring the panoramic views or evenings entertaining friends and family as the sun dips beneath the horizon. This home provides the rare opportunity to embrace a classic character lifestyle or to dream even bigger—renovate at your own pace or design the modern masterpiece you’ve always envisioned.\r\n\r\nNestled among some of Auckland’s most prestigious and sought-after residences, you’re not just purchasing a property; you are joining a community known for exclusivity and enduring value. As your trusted real estate partner, we’re dedicated to helping you realize the full potential of this incredible offering—whether you’re looking to move in, invest, or create a legacy for generations to come.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare. Feel the privilege, embrace the view, and let your future unfold.\r\n\r\nContact us today for your private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
